erty - description (en-us)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"The Real Estate Contributions Platform is the official electronic platform designated for the submission of applications to issue, amend, and cancel licenses required for real estate contribution activities. It also facilitates the acceptance of applications for the qualification and classification of real estate developers, and ensures the completion of all licensing and qualification processes electronically.","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - keywords","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"[\n  \"المساهمات\",\n  \"العقارية\",\n  \"المساهمات العقارية\",\n  \"Rega\",\n  \"الخدمات الالكترونية\",\n  \"تراخيص\",\n  \"مساهمات\"\n]","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - pageName (ar-jo)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"الخدمات الإلكترونية | المساهمات العقارية ","newValue":"المساهمات العقارية","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - pageName (en-us)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"Real Estate Contributions","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - serviceBrief (ar-jo)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"{\n  \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-align: center; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 12.0pt 0cm 12.0pt 0cm;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span class=\\\"MsoHyperlink\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif; mso-ascii-font-family: Calibri; mso-ascii-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-hansi-font-family: Calibri; mso-hansi-theme-font: minor-latin; mso-bidi-font-family: Arial; mso-bidi-theme-font: minor-bidi;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><a href=\\\"file:///C:/media/kwrbhkn2/نظام-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf#https://rega.gov.sa/media/kwrbhkn2/نظام-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\" title=\\\"https://rega.gov.sa/media/kwrbhkn2/نظام-المساهمات-العقارية.pdf\\\"><strong style=\\\"mso-ansi-font-weight: normal;\\