g, and promoting non-governmental real estate activities. Its main goal is to attract investments to the real estate sector while aligning with the comprehensive strategy of the sector.","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - pageName (ar-jo)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"عن الهيئة العامة للعقار","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - pageName (en-us)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"About the Real Estate General Authority","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - rightBrief (ar-jo)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"{\n  \"markup\": \"<p>تأسست الهيئة العامة للعقار عام 2017 لتنظيم النشاط العقاري غير الحكومي، والإشراف عليه، وتطويره بهدف تعزيز وتشجيع الاستثمار في القطاع العقاري، وتحقيق مستهدفات الاستراتيجية الشاملة للقطاع العقاري.</p>\\n<p>تسعى الهيئة إلى تحقيق استراتيجية القطاع العقاري من خلال:</p>\",\n  \"blocks\": {\n    \"contentData\": [],\n    \"settingsData\": []\n  }\n}","newValue":"{\n  \"markup\": \"<p>تأسست الهيئة العامة للعقار عام 2017 لتنظيم النشاط العقاري غير الحكومي، والإشراف عليه، وتطويره بهدف تعزيز وتشجيع الاستثمار في القطاع العقاري، وتحقيق مستهدفات الاستراتيجية الشاملة للقطاع العقاري.</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\",\n  \"blocks\": {\n    \"contentData\": [],\n    \"settingsData\": []\n  }\n}","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - rightBrief (en-us)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"{\n  \"markup\": \"<p>The Real Estate General Authority (REGA) was created in 2017 with the aim of regulating, overseeing, and promoting non-governmental real estate activities. Its main goal is to attract investments to the real estate sector while aligning with the comprehensive strategy of the sector.</p>\\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\\n<p>The Authority aims to fulfill the real estate sector's strategy by achieving the following objectives:</p>\",\n  \"blocks\": {\n    \"contentData\": [],\n    \"settingsData\": []\n  }\n}","newValue":"{\n  \"markup\": \"<p>The Real Estate General Authority (REGA) was created in 2017 with the aim of regulating, overseeing, and promoting non-governmental real estate activities. Its main goal is to attract investments to the real estate sector while aligning with the comprehensive strategy of the sector.</p>\",\n  \"blocks\": {\n    \"contentData\": [],\n    \"settingsData\": []\n  }\n}","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - rightFacts (ar-jo)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"a476b603-d6f6-40f2-8e24-7a786eae3dc5\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"تنظيم القطاع العقاري غير الحكومي\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>وضع اللوائح والأنظمة المُنظمة للنشاط العقاري الغير حكومي ويشمل ذلك إصدار التراخيص والتصاريح لممارسي الأنشطة العقارية.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"87709a70-c8a8-489a-9ba0-36b1a2025ffd\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 2\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"الإشراف على القطاع\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"مراقبة ومراجعة أنشطة القطاع العقاري غير الحكومي لضمان الامتثال للأنظمة والمعايير. كما تتبع وتقييم أداء وامتثال ممارسي الأنشطة العقارية. \\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"70bc87be-ea13-411b-89eb-19c21863e2bc\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 3\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"تمكين و تطوير القطاع\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"بناء وتطوير قدرات القطاع البشرية وتحسين كفاءة الخدمات المقدمة للقطاع، ووضع إجراءات لاستدامة الأصول العقارية، وتوفير البيانات والإحصائيات العقارية لاتخاذ القرارات وتعزيز الشفافية.\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"0c6d16ff-5d20-4686-8cf7-22effb354f41\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 4\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"تشجيع الاستثمار\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>تعزيز بيئة الاستثمار في القطاع العقاري من خلال تقديم مزيد من الفرص والتسهيلات للمستثمرين. يتم ذلك من خلال توفير معلومات دقيقة وشفافة حول المؤشرات العقارية السعودية، وجعل القطاع بيئة تنافسية</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  }\n]","newValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"a476b603-d6f6-40f2-8e24-7a786eae3dc5\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"تنظيم القطاع العقاري غير الحكومي\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>وضع اللوائح والأنظمة المُنظمة للنشاط العقاري الغير حكومي ويشمل ذلك إصدار التراخيص والتصاريح لممارسي الأنشطة العقارية.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"icon\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"key\\\": \\\"fe6db999-187d-415e-a0c3-25d9c968966c\\\",\\n    \\\"mediaKey\\\": \\\"e5220737-f37c-4b07-bbf3-a859ee5d873f\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"87709a70-c8a8-489a-9ba0-36b1a2025ffd\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 2\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"الإشراف على القطاع\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"مراقبة ومراجعة أنشطة القطاع العقاري غير الحكومي لضمان الامتثال للأنظمة والمعايير. كما تتبع وتقييم أداء وامتثال ممارسي الأنشطة العقارية. \\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"icon\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"key\\\": \\\"cf00ca1c-f2e9-4c31-b9f6-349fefec6f77\\\",\\n    \\\"mediaKey\\\": \\\"91b8b130-dda0-4199-a3b2-6127cb820ab1\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"70bc87be-ea13-411b-89eb-19c21863e2bc\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 3\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"تمكين و تطوير القطاع\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"بناء وتطوير قدرات القطاع البشرية وتحسين كفاءة الخدمات المقدمة للقطاع، ووضع إجراءات لاستدامة الأصول العقارية، وتوفير البيانات والإحصائيات العقارية لاتخاذ القرارات وتعزيز الشفافية.\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"icon\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"key\\\": \\\"b941f49e-ee08-4db1-ad4b-b140b339057d\\\",\\n    \\\"mediaKey\\\": \\\"4377a0e6-53fe-48bf-90f2-2475ae47abe3\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"0c6d16ff-5d20-4686-8cf7-22effb354f41\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 4\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"تشجيع الاستثمار\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>تعزيز بيئة الاستثمار في القطاع العقاري من خلال تقديم مزيد من الفرص والتسهيلات للمستثمرين. يتم ذلك من خلال توفير معلومات دقيقة وشفافة حول المؤشرات العقارية السعودية، وجعل القطاع بيئة تنافسية</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"icon\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"key\\\": \\\"eb060428-e5b3-4d3a-9c09-bea530fef478\\\",\\n    \\\"mediaKey\\\": \\\"98ce9afc-26e3-4fd1-9099-b4f75a15eef2\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"\n  }\n]","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - rightFacts (en-us)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"914b76ee-24cd-4bcd-9284-8fb4ba755175\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Organize the Non-Governmental Real Estate Sector \",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Authority is responsible for creating and enforcing rules and regulations for non-governmental real estate activities. This includes granting licenses and permits to individuals and organizations involved in the real estate sector.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"92c06cf4-9671-469d-9476-0e72c10cf749\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 2\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Supervise the Sector\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Authority oversees and assesses non-governmental real estate activities to ensure they adhere to regulations and standards. Additionally, it monitors and evaluates the compliance and performance of individuals and organizations involved in real estate activities.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"a90ad5eb-9036-497e-8890-4825684f2fda\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 3\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Empower and Develop the Sector \",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Authority focuses on enhancing the skills and capabilities of individuals in the real estate sector. It also aims to improve the efficiency of services provided to the sector, establish procedures to ensure the sustainability of real estate assets, and provide data and statistics to support decision-making and promote transparency.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"a9212296-8ac7-4f6a-b208-8f5d994fd877\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 4\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Encourage Investments \",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Authority aims to strengthen the investment ecosystem in the real estate sector by creating more opportunities and streamlining procedures for investors. This is achieved by offering accurate and transparent data on the Saudi Real Estate Indicators and fostering a competitive environment within the sector.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  }\n]","newValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"914b76ee-24cd-4bcd-9284-8fb4ba755175\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Organize the Non-Governmental Real Estate Sector \",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Authority is responsible for creating and enforcing rules and regulations for non-governmental real estate activities. This includes granting licenses and permits to individuals and organizations involved in the real estate sector.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"icon\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"key\\\": \\\"2c1481bf-aee8-4342-bc46-508fa1cab198\\\",\\n    \\\"mediaKey\\\": \\\"e5220737-f37c-4b07-bbf3-a859ee5d873f\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"92c06cf4-9671-469d-9476-0e72c10cf749\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 2\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Supervise the Sector\",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Authority oversees and assesses non-governmental real estate activities to ensure they adhere to regulations and standards. Additionally, it monitors and evaluates the compliance and performance of individuals and organizations involved in real estate activities.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"icon\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"key\\\": \\\"3265079d-d81f-4597-a778-5334b69cb631\\\",\\n    \\\"mediaKey\\\": \\\"91b8b130-dda0-4199-a3b2-6127cb820ab1\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"a90ad5eb-9036-497e-8890-4825684f2fda\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 3\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Empower and Develop the Sector \",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Authority focuses on enhancing the skills and capabilities of individuals in the real estate sector. It also aims to improve the efficiency of services provided to the sector, establish procedures to ensure the sustainability of real estate assets, and provide data and statistics to support decision-making and promote transparency.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"icon\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"key\\\": \\\"cf0e3fe5-a062-40d6-a9ea-643f78e4ee44\\\",\\n    \\\"mediaKey\\\": \\\"4377a0e6-53fe-48bf-90f2-2475ae47abe3\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"key\": \"a9212296-8ac7-4f6a-b208-8f5d994fd877\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 4\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"fact\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Encourage Investments \",\n    \"shortBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>The Authority aims to strengthen the investment ecosystem in the real estate sector by creating more opportunities and streamlining procedures for investors. This is achieved by offering accurate and transparent data on the Saudi Real Estate Indicators and fostering a competitive environment within the sector.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"icon\": \"[\\n  {\\n    \\\"key\\\": \\\"5c10a67c-1b81-47be-ab9a-928f264ace46\\\",\\n    \\\"mediaKey\\\": \\\"98ce9afc-26e3-4fd1-9099-b4f75a15eef2\\\"\\n  }\\n]\"\n  }\n]","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - rightFactsTitle (ar-jo)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"تسعى الهيئة إلى تحقيق استراتيجية القطاع العقاري من خلال:","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - rightFactsTitle (en-us)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"The Authority aims to fulfill the real estate sector's strategy by achieving the following objectives:","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - socialMediaImage","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"umb://media/ba6d866b399d4d158df62ecef4617b90","change":"Update"},{"su