ات الحكومية، وتقوم اللجنة بأعمالها لدعم القطاع العقاري، ورفع تصنيف المملكة التنافسي في مؤشر تسجيل الملكية.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  }\n]","newValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"d85cc10c-e772-41c4-9e70-7013c27010db\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"servicesFeatures\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"icon\": \"umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542\",\n    \"featureTabTitle\": \"عن الخدمة\",\n    \"featureBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>\\\\\\\"مُلكية\\\\\\\" لجنة معالجة أخطاء الملكية، وهي لجنة مستقلة عن الجهات الحكومية تعمل بحيادية لمعالجة تعثرات المستفيدين من تسجيل الملكية العقارية لدى الجهات الحكومية، وتقوم اللجنة بأعمالها لدعم القطاع العقاري، ورفع تصنيف المملكة التنافسي في مؤشر تسجيل الملكية.</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"customPage\": \"\",\n    \"linkedToPage\": \"\"\n  }\n]","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - serviceFeature (en-us)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"500fee2a-a2b3-4b08-aef2-09d3d588a26c\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"servicesFeatures\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"icon\": \"umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542\",\n    \"featureTabTitle\": \"About the Service \",\n    \"featureTitle\": null,\n    \"featureBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>“Mulkia” is the Committee for Addressing Property Registration Errors and works independently from governmental parties to objectively resolve beneficiaries’ dispersions in registering their real estate properties with government agencies. The committee conducts these activities to support the real estate sector and boost the Kingdom’s competitive ranking in the Property Registration Index.&nbsp;</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\"\n  }\n]","newValue":"[\n  {\n    \"key\": \"500fee2a-a2b3-4b08-aef2-09d3d588a26c\",\n    \"name\": \"Item 1\",\n    \"ncContentTypeAlias\": \"servicesFeatures\",\n    \"PropType\": null,\n    \"icon\": \"umb://media/a0df66c37ac6423084eb3fe30c460542\",\n    \"featureTabTitle\": \"About the Service \",\n    \"featureTitle\": null,\n    \"featureBrief\": \"{\\n  \\\"markup\\\": \\\"<p>“Mulkia” is the Committee for Addressing Property Registration Errors and works independently from governmental parties to objectively resolve beneficiaries’ dispersions in registering their real estate properties with government agencies. The committee conducts these activities to support the real estate sector and boost the Kingdom’s competitive ranking in the Property Registration Index.&nbsp;</p>\\\",\\n  \\\"blocks\\\": {\\n    \\\"contentData\\\": [],\\n    \\\"settingsData\\\": []\\n  }\\n}\",\n    \"customPage\": \"\",\n    \"linkedToPage\": \"\"\n  }\n]","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - socialMediaImage","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"umb://media/ba6d866b399d4d158df62ecef4617b90","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - support","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"{\n  \"layout\": {\n    \"Umbraco.BlockList\": [\n      {\n        \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/d0edf0b91cb94ba99dd16c98577a6607\"\n      },\n      {\n        \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/b2befc19127f4746b5004fefa320ecdb\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"contentData\": [\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"4612c786-ff7a-4b37-9bba-428c0b4bdfe9\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/b2befc19127f4746b5004fefa320ecdb\",\n      \"title\": \"\",\n      \"items\": {\n        \"layout\": {\n          \"Umbraco.BlockList\": [\n            {\n              \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/b4b4aa5317f548fbb8369fcf02479f60\"\n            },\n            {\n              \"contentUdi\": \"umb://element/1b1248cb3be945e3a579da1b80f271d3\"\n            },\n           