ab42078d3ac590fe065956\"\n      }\n    ]\n  },\n  \"contentData\": [\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/ed65fd41dd374e55a9ac54bf0edad1a8\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الأولى\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 21.45pt 0in 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">يؤهل المطورون العقاريون بناء على المعايير الآتية:<br>1- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات المالية.<br>2- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات الفنية.<br>3- &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; القدرات المؤسسية والموارد البشرية.</p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      },\n      \"header\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/6195238927a44bd996ad149d9359cb66\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثانية\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 95%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 21.45pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">يجتاز المطور العقاري التأهيل بعد حصوله على الدرجة وفق الآتي:</p>\\n<div>\\n<table border=\\\"1\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"680\\\" class=\\\"MsoTableGrid\\\" style=\\\"width: 510.3pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-table-dir: bidi;\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 23.35pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"425\\\" style=\\\"width: 318.7pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F4E79; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-