p;</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</div>\\n<p dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">&nbsp;</p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/d75a51d9717c4c398bb9f818511938b9\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السادسة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يشترط لاعتماد المكتب الاستشاري للمشروع العقاري الآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->سجل تجاري ساري المفعول.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">اجتياز (10%) أو (5) من مهندسي المكتب الاستشاري، البرنامج التأهيلي المعتمد من الهيئة أيهما أقل، على أن يكون مدير المشروع المرخص مجتازاً للبرنامج.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أن يكون مرخصاً من الهيئة السعودية للمهندسين.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا كانت قيمة المشروع العقاري الواحد أكثر من (خمسة وعشرين) مليون ريال، فيجب الحصول على شهادة تصنيف مقدمي خدمات المدن \\\"بلدي\\\"، على أن تتضمن (إدارة المشروعات الانشائية-الاستشارات الهندسية والمعمارية-الاستشارات الهندسية للتخطيط الحضري)، وأن تكون درجة التصنيف اللازمة للعمل على المشروع وفق الآتي:</span></p>\\n<div>\\n<table border=\\\"1\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"368\\\" class=\\\"MsoTableGrid\\\" style=\\\"width: 276.05pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-table-dir: bidi;\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 23.35pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"199\\\" style=\\\"width: 149.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F3864; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 23.35pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>درجة شهادة تصنيف مقدمي خدمات المدن</strong></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>\\\"بلدي\\\"</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"169\\\" style=\\\"width: 126.45pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F3864; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 23.35pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>الحد الأعلى لقيمة المشروع الواحد</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"199\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 149.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #F2F2F2; mso-background-themecolor: background1; mso-background-themeshade: 242; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>الأولى</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"169\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 126.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">غير محددة.</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"199\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 149.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #F2F2F2; mso-background-themecolor: background1; mso-background-themeshade: 242; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>الثانية</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"169\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 126.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">مليار ريال.</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"199\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 149.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #F2F2F2; mso-background-themecolor: background1; mso-background-themeshade: 242; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>الثالثة</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"169\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 126.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">خمس مئة مليون ريال.</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"199\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 149.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #F2F2F2; mso-background-themecolor: background1; mso-background-themeshade: 242; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>الرابعة</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"169\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 126.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">مئتين وخمسون مليون ريال.</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 5; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"199\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 149.6pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #F2F2F2; mso-background-themecolor: background1; mso-background-themeshade: 242; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>الخامسة</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"169\\\" valign=\\\"top\\\" style=\\\"width: 126.45pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 11.6pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">مئة مليون ريال.</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</div>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/379b0ca59edf42cb8132be03b4216ed1\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السابعة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يشترط لاعتماد المحاسب القانوني للمشروع العقاري الآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->سجل تجاري ساري المفعول.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أن يكون مرخصاً من الهيئة السعودية للمراجعين والمحاسبين.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">اجتياز (10%) أو (4) من محاسبي المكتب البرنامج التأهيلي المعتمد من الهيئة، أيهما أقل.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/bf6d867e45c54baaa3c0704c1d98b76e\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثامنة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجوز للمطور طلب (ترخيص تسويق المشروع العقاري) قبل ترخيص المشروع العقاري على الخارطة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يقدم المطور المستندات والبيانات لترخيص تسويق المشروع وفق الآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->رقم صك تسجيل ملكية العقار.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">رقم عقد التسويق بين الوسيط العقاري والمطور- إن وجد-.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">نسخة عقد التطوير بين المطور ومالك الأرض-إن وجد-.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌د-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->التصاميم المعمارية والمخططات الهندسية.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تبت الهيئة في طلب (ترخيص تسويق المشروع العقاري) خلال (عشرة) أيام عمل من تاريخ اكتمال الطلب، وفي حال الرفض فيجب أن يكون القرار مسبباً.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تكون مدة (ترخيص تسويق المشروع العقاري) بما لا يتجاوز (مئة وثمانين يوماً) ويجوز تمديدها للمشروعات التي لا تتطلب استلام أموال حجز الوحدات العقارية من المشترين أو المستأجرين، لمدة أو مدد مماثلة.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/5f2f0840905c4814a4ddf1ee3e238884\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة التاسعة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يلتزم الوسيط العقاري في تسويقه للمشروعات العقارية على الخارطة، لأحكام نظام الوساطة العقارية ولوائحه.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/349d7f2ed6bb4c63b9ab03fc04fe39d2\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة العاشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجب على المطور في حال رغبته باستلام مبلغ حجز وحدات عقارية من المشتري أو المستأجر خلال مدة (ترخيص تسويق المشروع العقاري) الالتزام بالآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الإفصاح عن حالة المشروع والمخططات المستقبلية له.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">عدم استلام أكثر من (5%) من قيمة الوحدة العقارية.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إيداع جميع مبالغ الحجز المستلمة في حساب الضمان</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"> </span>المخصص لذلك.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا انتهت المدة المحددة في ترخيص تسويق المشروع العقاري، ولم يستكمل المطور ترخيص المشروع، فتعيد الهيئة المبالغ المودعة في حساب الضمان إلى أصحابها.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/c34a049e08d54238b60c63e11079e1b7\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الحادية عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">مع مراعاة الأحكام الواردة في المادة (السادسة) من النظام يرخص للمشروع العقاري على الخارطة بعد استيفاء الآتي: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تقديم دراسة جدوى المشروع مشتملة -بالإضافة لما ورد في الفقرة (ك) من (</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\">1</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">) من المادة السادسة من النظام- على البيانات المالية، والانشائية، والتسويقية المقدرة للمشروع، والمصاريف المالية والإدارية المتوقعة، ومدة تسليم الوحدات ومصادر التمويل المتوقعة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">خطاب من (مركز خدمات المطورين \\\"إتمام\\\" أو أي جهة مختصة بتراخيص البناء) يفيد بمطابقة المشروع العقاري للمتطلبات النظامية لرخص البناء، والمخططات الهندسية، والتصاميم المعمارية، ويكتفى به عن المتطلبات الواردة في الفقرتين (د) و (ح) من المادة السادسة من النظام.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا كان المشروع يحتوي على وحدات عقارية مفرزة، فيجب إرفاق محضر فرز الوحدات المعتمد وفقاً لنظام ملكية الوحدات العقارية وفرزها وإدارتها.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">فيما عدا العقارات المسجلة عينياً؛ يجب إرفاق خطاب من مالك العقار بالموافقة على التأشير على صك تسجيل الملكية للعقار المراد تطويره بعدم التصرف في ملكيته إلى أن تستكمل أعمال التطوير العقاري.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraph\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">حصول المطور العقاري على نقاط التقييم وفقاً للجدول الآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<div>\\n<table border=\\\"1\\\" cellspacing=\\\"0\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\" width=\\\"586\\\" class=\\\"MsoTableGrid\\\" style=\\\"width: 439.6pt; border-collapse: collapse; border: none; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-yfti-tbllook: 1184; mso-padding-alt: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; mso-table-dir: bidi;\\\" dir=\\\"rtl\\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 0; mso-yfti-firstrow: yes; height: 23.35pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"343\\\" style=\\\"width: 257.35pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F3864; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 23.35pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: center; line-height: 85%; margin: 12.0pt 0in 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>مساحة المشروع العقاري</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"243\\\" style=\\\"width: 182.25pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; background: #1F3864; mso-background-themecolor: accent1; mso-background-themeshade: 128; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 23.35pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>النقاط المطلوبة</strong></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><strong>وفق المادة الخامسة من اللائحة</strong></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 1; height: 17.95pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"343\\\" style=\\\"width: 257.35pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 17.95pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">مشروع المطور الفرد</p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"243\\\" style=\\\"width: 182.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 17.95pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">35 نقطة فأكثر</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 2; height: 4.9pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"343\\\" style=\\\"width: 257.35pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 4.9pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">مشروع المطور –شخص اعتباري-، التي تقل مسطحات البناء عن 15,000م2</span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"243\\\" style=\\\"width: 182.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 4.9pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">35 نقطة فأكثر</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 3; height: 2.8pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"343\\\" style=\\\"width: 257.35pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">مشروع المطور –شخص اعتباري-، التي تقل مسطحات البناء عن 25,000م2</span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"243\\\" style=\\\"width: 182.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 2.8pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">45 نقطة فأكثر</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr style=\\\"mso-yfti-irow: 4; mso-yfti-lastrow: yes; height: 5.35pt;\\\">\\n<td width=\\\"343\\\" style=\\\"width: 257.35pt; border: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 5.35pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 16.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">مشروع المطور –شخص اعتباري-، التي تزيد مسطحات البناء عن 25,000م2</span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td width=\\\"243\\\" style=\\\"width: 182.25pt; border-top: none; border-left: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-bottom: solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right: none; mso-border-top-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-right-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; mso-border-alt: solid windowtext .5pt; padding: 0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt; height: 5.35pt;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-align: center; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">55 نقطة فأكثر</p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</div>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/540cd24918ca4a8fa65b90c1f32719ea\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثانية عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يُشترط لترخيص المشروع العقاري للشخص الطبيعي</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"> </span>الآتي:</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">ألا يتجاوز مسطح البناء في المشروع عن (5000) متر مربع.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">ألا تزيد مدة تنفيذ المشروع على (ثلاث سنوات). </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">ألا تتجاوز عدد المشروعات العقارية التي يسمح بتنفيذها سنوياً عن (ثلاثة) مشروعات.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/2f03189a5dbe4a2097b3e7dd82f9ab0b\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثالثة عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجوز للهيئة تقسيم المشروع العقاري إلى عدة نطاقات.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يشترط في تقسيم المشروع العقاري إلى عدة نطاقات الآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->موافقة الهيئة على البدء في النطاق.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->أن يكون لكل نطاق حساب ضمان مستقل.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أن يكون لكل نطاق تقارير هندسية ومالية مستقلة.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/8b565ffe76894538835511184bb154cc\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الرابعة عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">يلتزم المطور العقاري بالآتي:</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تقديم قوائم مالية عند نهاية المشروع العقاري –معدة من المحاسب القانوني- للهيئة، أو عند طلبها.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تزويد المشتري أو المستأجر بجميع المخططات الفعلية للوحدة العقارية والمنفذة على الطبيعة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تنفيذ المشروع حسب المواصفات المتفق عليها في العقود ودراسة الجدوى.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إيداع المبالغ من المشترين أو المستأجرين في حساب الضمان مباشرة.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/404beca320b64f59992fb3f755c0392b\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الخامسة عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\">يلتزم المحاسب القانوني بالآتي:</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">متابعة وتدقيق البيانات المالية الخاصة بقيمة الوحدات العقارية المتعاقد عليها، والتأكد من أنها أودعت في حساب الضمان.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إعداد تقارير العمليات المالية والمحاسبية لحساب الضمان، وقائمة المركز المالي للمشروع، وأوجه الصرف من حساب الضمان مرفقًا بها المستندات اللازمة، أو عند طلب الهيئة.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/2f2d0f6625974744953da269b3ccf2b8\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السادسة عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا كان عقار المشروع مسجلاً عينياً وفقاً لنظام التسجيل العيني للعقار؛ فيجب توثيق جميع العقود والتصرفات في (سجل البيع على الخارطة) لدى السجل العقاري.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/f2cbc8939abb4914bfac964e96b9fd71\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السابعة عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">فيما عدا العقارات المسجلة عينياً وفقاً لنظام التسجيل العيني للعقار؛ يؤشر على صك ملكية العقار -محل المشروع العقاري- لدى الجهة المختصة بالتوثيق بعدم التصرف في ملكيته إلى أن تستكمل أعمال التطوير العقاري، أو إلى أن يسجل العقار لدى السجل العقاري، وإصدار وثيقة التسجيل وفق نظام التسجيل العيني للعقار ولائحته. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يشترط للتأشير على صك تسجيل الملكية للعقار المرهون، موافقة المرتهن.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/b98b5755a1544462b9402d15bab0fd6b\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثامنة عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجوز رفع التأشير بعدم التصرف عن صك تسجيل الملكية للعقار المراد تطويره قبل استكمال المشروع العقاري، بعد موافقة الهيئة في الحالات الآتية:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->المشروعات المقامة على أراضٍ حكومية.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">استكمال إجراءات الفرز، أو الدمج، أو التعديل، أو نقل الملكية.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الإفراغ للمشتري قبل إنجاز الوحدة العقارية.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/6035652ded5b4df6998631fdd5d3b505\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة التاسعة عشرة\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تعد الهيئة نموذجاً استرشادياً للاتفاقية المبرمة بين المطور العقاري وبين مالك الأرض أو مالك منفعتها، على أن تتضمن الاتفاقية مسؤولية المطور العقاري والمالك والتزامهم أمام المشتري أو المستأجر.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تعد الهيئة نموذجاً استرشادياً للاتفاقية المبرمة بين المطور الرئيس والمطور الفرعي-إن وجد- ونموذجاً للاتفاقيات بين المطور وبين المكتب الاستشاري، والمحاسب القانوني، والوسيط العقاري -إن وجد-.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/e7fc3b4f90c840389de3845879f6d7f3\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة العشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تعد الهيئة عقداً نموذجياً للبيع بين مالك الأرض والمطور وبين المشتري أو المستأجر -وذلك فيما عدا العقارات المسجلة عينياً وفق نظام التسجيل العيني للعقار-، يتضمن ما يلي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->جدول الدفعات المالية.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الأحكام المترتبة على تأخر المشتري أو المستأجر في سداد الدفعات المالية. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الأحكام المتعلقة بالتعويض وأجرة المثل عند تأخر المطور في تسليم الأرض أو الوحدة العقارية، بما في ذلك أحكام فسخ العقد.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌د-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">مدة تنفيذ المشروع بما في ذلك المدد الإضافية التي يجوز منحها للمطور.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ه-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أحكام الملكية المشتركة، وفق ما ورد في نظام ملكية الوحدات العقارية وفرزها وإدارتها ولائحته.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 85%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">ويجوز للمطور تعديل هذا العقد بعد موافقة الهيئة. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; line-height: 85%; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تضمن البيانات الواردة في الفقرة رقم (1) من هذه المادة في توثيق التصرف في العقار الموصوف على الخارطة بين أطرافه، وفقاً لنظام التسجيل العيني للعقار ولائحته.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجب أن يتضمن عقد مالك الأرض والمطور مع المشتري والمستأجر الإقرار بأن للهيئة إحلال مطور بديل في الحالات التي تقتضيها ظروف تعثر المشروع العقاري، طبقًا للنظام واللائحة وأفضل الممارسات.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/895a552b924541ea97866220614ca031\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الحادية والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تكون ملكية الأجزاء المشتركة في المشروع العقاري والتصرف فيها، وفقاً لأحكام نظام ملكية الوحدات العقارية وفرزها وإدارتها ولائحته.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/7ab170665cce4c6b93567d09853bed75\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثانية والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يتيح المطور لكل مشترٍ ومستأجر، أو من ينوب عنهما؛ الاطلاع على السجل المحاسبي لوحدته العقارية، بناء على طلب يقدّم للمطور.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">على المطور تزويد المشتري أو المستأجر بنسخة من السجل المحاسبي لوحدته خلال (عشرة أيام) عمل.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/b497fabec85d4bfeafcbe2ae5b29f9cf\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثالثة والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تنشئ الهيئة قاعدة بيانات للمشروعات العقارية على الخارطة، وعلى المطور أن يضيف فيها ما يلي: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أسماء المقاولين والمكتب الاستشاري والمحاسب القانوني.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->بيانات ومواصفات تنفيذ المشروع.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">التقارير الصادرة من المكتب الاستشاري، والمحاسب القانوني، والبنك، وشهادات الانجاز.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">محاضر تعديل المخططات التنفيذية، ونسخاً من المخططات المنفذة فعلياً.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->بيانات الموردين وشهادات الضمان.</p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/6a606f7f6bc04024a6db372a0de0eace\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الرابعة والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تتيح الهيئة –من قاعدة البيانات- لاطلاع العموم ما يلي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">اسم المشروع العقاري، وبيانات صك تسجيل الملكية، والمخطط المعتمد، وموقعه، ومساحته، وعدد وحداته، ونوعها، ومكونات وحداتها، وبيانات الموردين، وبيانات ومواصفات تنفيذ المشروع، وتقارير سير العمل، وتقارير المكتب الاستشاري، والمحاسب القانوني. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->اسم المطور، وتصنيفه.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">اسم المكتب الاستشاري، والمحاسب القانوني، والبنك، والمسوق أو الوسيط العقاري-إن وجد-.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">مدة المشروع العقاري، وتاريخ البدء والتسليم.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">استطلاع آراء المشترين أو المستأجرين بشأن الخدمات المقدمة من المطور.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/5e0bda6081f34600adfd0ac69da31b49\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الخامسة والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">للهيئة طلب تقرير سير المشروع العقاري من المكتب الاستشاري، أو المحاسب القانوني، أو البنك، كل (شهر) في الحالات الآتية: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا تجاوزت مسطحات البناء للمشروع العقاري (5000) متر مربع، أو إذا تجاوزت عدد الوحدات العقارية في المشروع العقاري (ثلاثين) وحدة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا كان المشروع العقاري من المشروعات الحكومية.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا كان المشروع واقع في المناطق الخاضعة للتطوير الحكومي.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌د-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->أي حالة أخرى تحددها الهيئة.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">فيما عدا الحالات الواردة في الفقرة رقم (1) من هذه المادة؛ للهيئة طلب تقرير سير المشروع العقاري من المكتب الاستشاري، أو المحاسب القانوني، أو البنك، كل (ثلاثة) أشهر.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/f77204d0b3054ebe9b052dd0460b8f39\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السادسة والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تضمن اتفاقية فتح حساب الضمان بين المطور وبين البنك الآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أن يكون لكل مشروع حساب ضمان مستقل، ويكون له رقماً موحداً يعد مرجعًا للإيداع.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->أن يكون حساب الضمان (بالريال السعودي).</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">التزام المطور بعدم الصرف من الحساب إلا للأغراض الخاصة بالمشروع.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">شروط وإجراءات الصرف من حساب الضمان بما يتفق مع أحكام النظام واللائحة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أن يقتصر الصرف من حساب الضمان من خلال شيكات أو حوالات فقط.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 6 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أن يكون لكل عملية إيداع رقم مرجع مذكور فيه رقم الوحدة العقارية، بناء على عقد المطور مع المشتري أو المستأجر.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 7 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">عدم إسناد مهام البنك المبنية على الاتفاق مع المطور، إلى طرف ثالث أثناء فترة تنفيذ المشروع لأي سبب.</span><a name=\\\"_Hlk164751751\\\"></a></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-bookmark: _Hlk164751751;\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>8 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أن تزوّد الهيئة -عند طلبها- بكشف حساب الضمان</span></span>.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 9 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">عدم إغلاق حساب الضمان بالاتفاق مع المطور إلا بعد موافقة الهيئة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">10 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">عدم إصدار بطاقات صرف آلي أو بطاقات ائتمان على حساب الضمان</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\">.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/76815f474507461ea1140bf4d4d3e07e\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السابعة والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يتم الصرف من حساب الضمان بموجب وثيقة الصرف المقدمة من المطور إلى البنك على أن تكون مصادقة من المكتب الاستشاري والمحاسب القانوني ومتضمنة المبالغ ومبررات الصرف، ويجوز أن تكون وثائق الصرف من خلال وسائل التقنية الآمنة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 18.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">على المطور والمكتب الاستشاري والمحاسب القانوني تحديد المفوض من قبل كل منهم للمصادقة على وثيقة الصرف، وتزويد البنك بتواقيعهم.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/1adf9545aecc435eb3e2ceaf7162b46d\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثامنة والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">مع مراعاة المادة الحادية عشرة من النظام يجوز بطلب من الهيئة الصرف من حساب الضمان في الحالات الآتية:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->سداد المستحقات المالية للجهات الحكومية.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->إعادة المبالغ للمشترين أو المستأجرين.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">صرف مستحقات أطراف المشروع حال استحقاقها وعدم تعاون المطور.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تحويل موجودات حساب الضمان لحساب الضمان للمطور البديل.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إصلاح العيوب في المشروع وفق ما ورد في الفقرة رقم (3) من المادة (الحادية والثلاثون) من اللائحة.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/9773996d955248578f6384b392b2d8a8\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة التاسعة والعشرون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يعد من المصاريف غير الانشائية للمشروع المرخص له الآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->سداد قيمة الأرض للمالك.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->سداد مبالغ التمويل.</p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/ad68673dc37d4356860d8c81762e9526\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا رغب المطور سحب ما يفيض عن التكلفة الفعلية، فيرفع تقريراً مالياً لإنهاء المشروع إلى الهيئة، متضمناً تكلفة المشروع الفعلية على أن تكون مبنية على عقود مع الموردين والمقاولين ومقدمي الخدمات، ومصادقًا عليها من المكتب الاستشاري والمحاسب القانوني.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا أجازت الهيئة التقرير؛ أصدرت إذنًا للمكتب الاستشاري والمحاسب القانوني بالتوقيع على أوامر الصرف للمبالغ الفائضة إلى المطور، ولا يعفي ذلك عن مسؤولية المطور والمكتب الاستشاري والمحاسب القانوني في أي مرحلة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">للهيئة منع صرف الفائض إذا رأت تأخر المطور في مراحل العمل، أو عند الإخلال بالجودة المتعاقد عليها.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجوز للهيئة تحديد الصرف بجزء من المبلغ الفائض، وفقاً لتقديرها وملاءة المطور وسجل مشروعاته العقارية السابقة.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/b5c77a3c94c74f7ba56817f529cc3b2f\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الحادية والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">مع مراعاة المادة (الرابعة عشرة) من النظام يحظر على المحاسب القانوني صرف المبلغ المحتفظ به في حساب الضمان، إذا تبين للمكتب الاستشاري، أو المشتري، أو المستأجر، وجود عيوب في الإنشاءات أو التشطيب، بموجب تقرير من خبير مرخص نظاماً، وتُصدر الهيئة قراراً بإصلاح العيوب.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">للهيئة تمديد الاحتفاظ بالمبلغ، أو تطلب تمديد الضمان البنكي -بحسب الأحوال- لمدة (ستة) أشهر، تبدأ بعد صدور قرار إصلاح العيوب.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا أشعرت الهيئة المطور العقاري بالعيوب، ولم يقم بالبدء بإصلاحها خلال (خمسة أيام) من تاريخ إبلاغه فيجوز للهيئة التصرف بالمبلغ المحجوز لإصلاح العيوب، أو مصادرة مبلغ الضمان البنكي، في حدود التكلفة التقديرية للإصلاح.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجوز صرف المبلغ المحتفظ به في حساب الضمان وإعادة مبلغ الضمان البنكي للمطور قبل انقضاء المدة المحددة في المادة (الرابعة عشرة) من النظام إذا قدم وثيقة تأمين على العيوب الخفية للمباني والإنشاءات معتمدة من هيئة التأمين، على ألا تقل مدتها عن (سنة).</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/fa63cfc675ea4404a0c3c9c2cf3db6e3\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثانية والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">لا يجوز للمطور تعديل المخططات التنفيذية المعتمدة إلا بعد موافقة الهيئة والمشترين أو المستأجرين.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/e0e68a96affd4a6ea310ea3e66926059\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثالثة والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجب على المكتب الاستشاري، والمحاسب القانوني، -كل فيما يخصه- إبلاغ الهيئة عن أي مخالفة لأحكام النظام واللائحة، أو الإخلال بالالتزامات التعاقدية للمطور تجاه المشترين والمستأجرين، خلال مدة لا تزيد عن (خمسة) أيام عمل من تاريخ العلم بها.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/c31e8cd000e24240a01f90119d44ac95\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الرابعة والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يعد المطور متأخراً عن تنفيذ المشروع إذا لم ينجز المشروع بعد انتهاء مدته دون سبب خارج عن إرادته.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجوز أن تمنح الهيئة مدة إضافية لتنفيذ المشروع بعد انتهاء مدته، على ألا تزيد عن (سنة).</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يعد المطور متعثراً عن تنفيذ المشروع في الحالات الآتية:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-<span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا لم ينجز المشروع بعد انتهاء مدته بما في ذلك المدة الإضافية الممنوحة له.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.25in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا توقفت أعمال التنفيذ لمدة تزيد عن (مئة وثمانين) يوماً في أي مرحلة من مراحل المشروع.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-right: .5in; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">ما لم يقدم المطور سبباً مشروعاً تقبله الهيئة.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/61f3906ad2774dbe9227e0ae6d4f06ef\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الخامسة والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يلتزم المطور عند تأخره عن تسليم الأرض أو الوحدة العقارية في الموعد المحدد لإنجازه -دون سبب خارج عن إرادته- بدفع تعويض مادي للمشتري أو المستأجر وفق الآتي:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا كان المشروع أرضاً مطورة؛ فيكون التعويض بناء على اتفاق الأطراف على ألا يقل عن نسبة 2% من قيمة البيع تحتسب على أساس سنوي.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا كان المشروع وحدة عقارية؛ فيكون التعويض بناء على اتفاق الأطراف على ألا يقل عن أجرة المثل للوحدة من مقيم معتمد.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/d25be1c92e0642b7991840866f466e7a\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السادسة والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تصدر الهيئة دليلًا فنياً لمعالجة المشروعات العقارية المتأخرة والمتعثرة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجب أن يتضمن الدليل الفني جميع البيانات اللازمة فنياً وفقاً لأفضل الممارسات، ومنها: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">‌وصف أنواع تأخر وتعثر المشروعات العقارية ودرجاتها.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">‌الطرق والأساليب والإجراءات الواجب اتباعها لمعالجة التأخر أو التعثر، بما في ذلك خطط إدارة تصحيح إنجازها، وتقرير التغييرات اللازمة لاستكمالها، بما في ذلك تغيير تابعي المطور، وتعديل المواصفات، دون إخلال بحقوق المشترين أو المستأجرين.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->أدوات التدخل الرئيسة لمعالجة التأخر أو التعثر.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌د-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">‌إعادة الهيكلة المالية بما في ذلك خيارات سد فجوات التمويل حال وجودها، وخيارات التمويل في حال اقتضى تأخر أو تعثر المشروع العقاري تمويلاً إضافياً.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ه-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">آليات منح المدد الإضافية للمشروعات العقارية.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/733458372d904fd2a1a380bef36b038d\",\n      \"title\": \" المادة السابعة والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تؤهل الهيئة جهات خبرة في تقويم تعثر مشروعات التطوير العقاري، وإدارة تصحيح مسارها؛ وذلك وفقاً لأفضل ممارسات المجال، وللهيئة الاستعانة بالاستشاريين المتخصصين لمساندتها في التأهيل. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تطرح منافسة -وفقاً للأنظمة المرعية- لاختيار الجهة المتخصصة بتقويم وتصحيح تعثر المشروعات العقارية لكل مشروع متعثر على حده.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/0b525757c3384f25929deb730228a8e9\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثامنة والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تشكل الهيئة لجنة متخصصة للإشراف على معالجة المشروعات العقارية المتأخرة والمتعثرة، ولها الاستعانة بالخبراء لدعم اللجنة بالخبرة اللازمة، ويكون للجنة كامل الاختصاصات المقررة في النظام واللائحة، والدليل الفني لمعالجة المشروعات العقارية المتأخرة والمتعثرة. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تتخذ اللجنة التدابير الواجبة لحماية حقوق ذوي العلاقة لإكمال المشروع العقاري المرخص، ومن ذلك:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">‌تعيين شخص مؤهل لإدارة العلاقة مع المطور لمعالجة تعثر المشروع العقاري.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">‌فحص ومتابعة عمل المطور، والمكتب الاستشاري، والمحاسب القانوني.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">‌إلزام المطور باستبدال المتسببين في تعثر المشروع العقاري. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌د-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">‌صرف مبالغ من حساب ضمان المشروع العقاري إذا كان لازماً لتصحيح مسار المشروع.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ه-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->‌إحلال مطور بديل.</p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/411bd50a9c9a496b8e4ec60255c21a9b\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة التاسعة والثلاثون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">إذا تعذرت التصفية الرضائية للمشروع العقاري المتعثر؛ فتحيل الهيئة المشروع إلى المحكمة المختصة.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/27429907113544569bbf16a5031cbb34\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الأعمال التي يجوز إسنادها إلى القطاع الخاص هي أعمال الإشراف الفني ومنها ما يلي: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الإشراف على المكاتب الاستشارية، والمحاسبين القانونيين، في تنفيذ واجباتهم التعاقدية.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">متابعة تنفيذ المشروعات العقارية بعد ترخيصها؛ وفقاً للالتزامات الإشرافية والتعاقدية، على أن يرفع للهيئة تقارير دورية عنها وأن ينفذ توجيهاتها وفقاً لاختصاصها. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->الرقابة والتفتيش على المشروعات العقارية.</p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/e66c6a227c8048329b16c05bb4062b65\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الحادية والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-indent: 22.5pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تسند الأعمال إلى القطاع الخاص وفقاً لنظام المنافسات والمشتريات الحكومية، وبناء على عقد ينظم تفصيلاً للالتزامات بما يحقق تنفيذ النظام واللائحة، على أن يتضمن تقسيم الوظائف الأساسية للمهام المسندة إلى القطاع الخاص مما يقتضيه تنفيذ تلك الأعمال، ويجوز أن تسند الأعمال إلى جهات متعددة في القطاع الخاص.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/8755e28605a0426a96b80814106c790f\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثانية والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يتولى مسؤولو الضبط الذين يصدر تعينهم بقرار من الهيئة، ضبط مخالفات أنشطة البيع أو التأجير على الخارطة وممارساتها، التي لا تتفق مع أحكام النظام واللائحة؛ بموجب محضر، متضمناً الآتي: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">‌‌اسم المخالف وبياناته، واسم المشروع العقاري، ومكان ضبط المخالفة، وزمانها، وتاريخها.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->‌<span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">اسم مسؤول الضبط الذي رصد المخالفة، وصفته. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->‌<span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تحديد نوع وعدد المخالفات المضبوطة، والأدلة والقرائن المستند عليها. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌د-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">كامل أقوال من تنسب إليه المخالفة، بما في ذلك أوجه دفاعه.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ه-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->النتائج التي انتهى إليها مسؤول الضبط.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌و-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">توقيع المحضر من محرره ومن المخالف، أو من يقوم مقامه، مع بيان صفته، وفي حال رفضه التوقيع يشار إلى ذلك في المحضر.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجوز استخدام الوسائل الإلكترونية الحديثة عند ممارسة صلاحيات الضبط.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">لمسؤولي الضبط في سبيل تأدية مهامهم البحث والتحري ومتابعة البلاغات والشكاوى عن مخالفات النظام واللائحة، ولهم الاستعانة برجال الضبط الجنائي عند اللزوم؛ لدعمهم في عملهم وضبطهم للمخالفات.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/d968564d9290470da921f58721752b95\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثالثة والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">المخالفات الجسيمة لأحكام النظام واللائحة هي</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\">:</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\"> </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الأفعال الواردة في المادة (الرابعة والعشرون) من النظام.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الأفعال المرتبطة بالغش أو التضليل، أو التحايل أو الخيانة، وكانت عن قصد وعمد، أو ترتب عليها ضرر بالغ على صحة الإنسان، أو سلامته، أو الصحة العامة، أو البيئة، أو المرفق العام.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/f2c79532be5240679b89d5f7317de701\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الرابعة والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تنظر لجنة النظر في مخالفات أحكام النظام واللائحة وإيقاع العقوبات، المخالفات المضبوطة، وتكون قواعد عملها وفق الآتي: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تعقد اللجنة اجتماعاتها في المركز الرئيس للهيئة، أو إلكترونياً وفق ما تراه، ولها أن تعقد اجتماعاتها خارج الهيئة متى دعت الحاجة لذلك.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">لا تنعقد اجتماعات اللجنة إلا بحضور أغلبية أعضائها، على أن يكون من بينهم رئيس اللجنة أو نائبه.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تعد اجتماعات اللجنة ومداولاتها سرية، ولا يجوز حضور غير أعضائها إلا بموافقة رئيس اللجنة.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يعد أمين اللجنة محضراً لكل اجتماع؛ يُدون فيه تاريخ انعقاده، ووقته، ومكانه، والحاضرون فيه، والمخالفات المنظورة، والإجراءات والوقائع المتداولة أثناء الاجتماع، والقرارات الصادرة، ويوقّع من رئيس اللجنة أو نائبه، والأعضاء الحاضرين.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>5 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجوز تحرير محضر الاجتماع، ورفعه، وتوقيعه إلكترونياً.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 6 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">على رئيس اللجنة تنظيم الأعمال والمهام بين الأعضاء.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/7724781d2b3d4a93be2cb64e1a88ce83\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الخامسة والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يجب على كل من نسبت إليه المخالفة -والأشخاص ذوي العلاقة- التعاون التام مع اللجنة في الكشف عن أي معلومات أو بيانات تطلبها اللجنة. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">للجنة الاطلاع على جميع المعلومات المتعلقة بالمخالفة؛ بما فيها المعلومات السرية.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تصدر اللجنة قرار إيقاع العقوبة متضمنًا الآتي: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->اسم المخالف، وبياناته الأساسية.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ب-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">النص النظامي الذي تمت مخالفته، ووصف المخالفة المرتكبة، وملخص الوقائع ذات الصلة فيها، والدفوع المؤثرة المقدمة من المخالف، والرد عليها، ومنطوق القرار، وأسبابه. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ج-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">رقم القرار وتاريخه، وتوقيع رئيس اللجنة، أو نائبه.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌د-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">النص على حق المخالف في الاعتراض على قرار إيقاع العقوبة، وفقًا للإجراءات المنظمة لذلك.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌ه-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->أي إضافة ترى اللجنة مناسبتها.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌و-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->ويجوز تحرير القرار، ورفعه، وتوقيعه إلكترونيًا.</p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يعتمد الرئيس التنفيذي للهيئة قرار اللجنة، وتكون القرارات نافذة من تاريخ صدورها، ما لم يصدر أمر من المحكمة الإدارية بوقف تنفيذها.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 5 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">تتولى الهيئة من تلقاء نفسها أو بناء على طلب المخالف تصحيح ما يقع في قرارها من أخطاء مادية، وإذا وقع غموض أو إيهام في القرار؛ فإن للمخالف أن يطلب من الهيئة تفسيره.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/96b393e19a494ab2b2f10fbf564e605e\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السادسة والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يصرف لرئيس وأعضاء وأمين اللجنة مكافأة قدرها (2000) ألفي ريال عن كل اجتماع يحضره، على ألا تزيد عن (20.000) عشرين ألف ريال شهرياً لكل عضو.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l1 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يشترط لاستحقاق مكافأة اللجنة توفر الآتي: </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -71.1pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -7.45pt; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo2; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 71.1pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>‌أ-&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أن تباشر اللجنة أعمالها خارج وقت الدوام الرسمي. </span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ب- ألا يكون الرئيس أو العضو متفرغاً لأعمال اللجنة. </span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/a0445566f1e543c2821f9574a3302065\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة السابعة والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"margin-bottom: 0in; text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يتحقق الإبلاغ بقرارات الهيئة أو لجنة النظر في المخالفات وإيقاع العقوبات بإحدى الوسائل الآتية</span><span>:</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpFirst\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>1 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">الرسائل النصية المرسلة عبر الهاتف المحمول الموثق</span><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\">.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt .0001pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\"><span style=\\\"font: 7.0pt 'Times New Roman';\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span>2 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->البريد الإلكتروني<span>.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpMiddle\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 3 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">أحد الحسابات المسجلة في أي من الأنظمة الآلية الحكومية.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"mso-add-space: auto; text-align: justify; text-justify: kashida; text-kashida: 0%; text-indent: -35.65pt; mso-text-indent-alt: -.05in; line-height: 85%; mso-list: l0 level1 lfo1; direction: rtl; unicode-bidi: embed; margin: 0in 35.65pt 12.0pt 0in;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoListParagraphCxSpLast\\\"><!-- [if !supportLists]--><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif; mso-fareast-font-family: 'Traditional Arabic';\\\"><span style=\\\"mso-list: Ignore;\\\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 4 -&nbsp; </span></span><!--[endif]-->البريد المسجل<span>.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/03870778426b4c7988c9de0a1cc21b60\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة الثامنة والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p style=\\\"text-indent: 21.45pt; line-height: 85%;\\\" dir=\\\"RTL\\\" class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 20.0pt; line-height: 85%; font-family: 'Traditional Arabic',serif;\\\" lang=\\\"AR-SA\\\">يصدر المجلس جدولاً للمقابل المالي الذي تتقاضاه الهيئة لما تقدمه من خدمات بناء على أحكام النظام.</span></p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"contentTypeKey\": \"2acf2487-14ef-411a-a9b2-bb4c58ec9392\",\n      \"udi\": \"umb://element/62b4acb46cac4479919914524ff91a9d\",\n      \"title\": \"المادة التاسعة والأربعون\",\n      \"content\": {\n        \"markup\": \"<p>تنشر اللائحة في الجريدة الرسمية</p>\",\n        \"blocks\": {\n          \"contentData\": [],\n          \"settingsData\": []\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"settingsData\": []\n}","newValue":"","change":"Delete"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - description","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"(Blank)","newValue":"اللائحة التنفيذية لنظام بيع وتأجير مشروعات عقارية على الخارطة","change":"Update"},{"success":true,"name":"Property - header (ar-jo)","path":"/Properties/*/Value","oldValue":"اللائحة التنفيذية لنظام بيع وتأجير مشروعات عقارية على الخارطة","newValue":"","change":